  - question: 11. If you have me, you want to share me. If you share me, you haven't
      got me. What am I?
    optionA: A) Love
    optionB: B) A Secret
    optionC: C) Silence
    optionD: D) Money
    correctAnswerIndex: 1
  - question: 12. I am always hungry, I must always be fed. The finger I touch will
      soon turn red. What am I?
    optionA: A) A Rose
    optionB: B) Rust
    optionC: C) Fire
    optionD: D) An Oven
    correctAnswerIndex: 2
  - question: 13. What can you catch, but never throw?
    optionA: A) A Ball
    optionB: B) A Cold
    optionC: C) A Shadow
    optionD: D) A Secret
    correctAnswerIndex: 1
  - question: 14. What has a mouth but cannot speak, has a bed but cannot sleep,
      and has a head but never thinks?
    optionA: A) A River
    optionB: B) A Mountain
    optionC: C) A Ghost
    optionD: D) A Grave
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
  - question: 15. What is so fragile that saying its name breaks it?
    optionA: A) Glass
    optionB: B) A Promise
    optionC: C) Silence
    optionD: D) A Bubble
    correctAnswerIndex: 2
